// What a settlement is built of (terra_build::village, D229, D290): each of its builders'
// roles, a construction material by its file's name in data/kits. The roof over each of the
// first three is that material's own (`roof_kind`). Another people's village names others.
(
    timber: "logs",
    masonry: "stone",
    beams: "hewn",
    cob: "earth",
    framed: "wattle",
)
